{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Royal\u2019s Gambit</i> is a retro-inspired, turn-based card strategy game where every decision counts. Face off against intricate 16-card stage patterns made of powerful royal face cards standing in your way. To clear a path to the exit, you'll need to match card values to their health\u2014planning carefully with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and refine your deck as you advance, unlocking new tools and strategies to overcome tougher stages. Each choice impacts your score, which rises with smart plays, combos, and risk-reward multipliers. But beware\u2014failure means starting over, making every run a high-stakes gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With multiple game modes and over 80 unique stages, <i>Royal\u2019s Gambit</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt on the fly, and master the board in pursuit of the perfect run\u2014all presented with nostalgic pixel visuals and stylized retro effects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597530?t=1752021035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597530?t=1752021035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597530/7a64260e0822a0e75408538b6dc0244122e08c9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752021035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597530/7a64260e0822a0e75408538b6dc0244122e08c9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752021035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3779220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Royal\u2019s Gambit</i> is a retro-inspired, turn-based card strategy game where every decision counts. Face off against intricate 16-card stage patterns made of powerful royal face cards standing in your way. To clear a path to the exit, you'll need to match card values to their health\u2014planning carefully with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and refine your deck as you advance, unlocking new tools and strategies to overcome tougher stages. Each choice impacts your score, which rises with smart plays, combos, and risk-reward multipliers. But beware\u2014failure means starting over, making every run a high-stakes gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With multiple game modes and over 80 unique stages, <i>Royal\u2019s Gambit</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt on the fly, and master the board in pursuit of the perfect run\u2014all presented with nostalgic pixel visuals and stylized retro effects.</p>","developers":["96 Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597530/40aa8c4484024e971dc9b3bf53d306d1c52930c4/header.jpg?t=1752021035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257138768,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138768/movie480.mp4?t=1747079893","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138768/movie_max.mp4?t=1747079893"},"name":"Royal's Gambit - Quick Tease Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138768/6dc8d0a7a9dc8f8aa6eaeae98a510dcd521d0258/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747079893","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138768/mo